<title>UK: L-Bank sets 200 billion lire 10-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>L-Bank sets 200 billion lire 10-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   L-BANK</p>
<p> AMT    200 BLN LIRE  COUPON     7.30	MATURITY    12.DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.37    PAY DATE    12.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.75	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
